The  driver  provides  support for the 3Dlabs Permedia 3 / Oxygen
VX1 / Proformance 3 series of graphics cards and provides an  in‐
terface  for machine independent driver.  Currently does not sup‐
port anti‐alias font rendering and OpenLDI video interface.  How‐
ever, it is capable of changing the resolution and uses  DDC2  to
pick  an appropriate video mode.  A 2D graphics engine is used to
accelerate scrolling, rectangle fills and bitmap font  rendering.
